flowchart LR
  K[1 Kitting] --> I[2 Integration] --> F[3 Functional test]
  F -- pass --> E[4 Environmental test<br/>vibration + thermal vacuum chamber]
  F -- fail --> I
  E -- pass --> A[6 Final acceptance + ship]
  E -- fail --> M[5 Material review board]
